 omarchy-mac/README.md                         |  2 +
 omarchy-mac/bin/omarchy-mac-setup-system      | 20 +++++
 omarchy-mac/test/powerprofiles-floor-test.sh  | 88 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../omarchy-mac-powerprofiles-floor.service   | 20 +++++
 5 files changed, 131 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
